#====================================================================
# DRAFT-gli-0.8.2.0-headeronly-ship-bundled-dep-headers.kv
# gli 0.8.2.0 header-only 库公开头引用内置依赖头（GLM 0.9.8）——
# Conan 打包必须随包分发 vendored 依赖头，否则消费者编译失败
# Draft only. Do not promote into knowledge/graph until promoted.
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-gli-0.8.2.0-headeronly-ship-bundled-dep-headers
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|clang
phase:                  packaging|compilation
error_signature:        fatal error: 'glm/glm.hpp' file not found|
                         No such file or directory.*include/|header-only.*package.*missing
severity:               2
category:               headers, conan, packaging, compat
match_keywords:         header-only, vendored, bundled, external/, glm, include path,
                         package(), copy, ship, dependency headers, consumer build,
                         find_package, INTERFACE, strip_root, include/glm
title:                  Header-only 库公开头引用内置 vendored 依赖头时，Conan 打包必须把该依赖头目录一并装入 include/，否则消费者编译失败
root_cause:             Header-only 库（如 gli 0.8.2.0）的公开头（gli/type.hpp）直接
                         `#include <glm/glm.hpp>`；上游把该依赖（GLM 0.9.8）vendored 在
                         external/glm 并通过 CMake include_directories(external/glm) 注入。
                         Conan 配方若只 package() 复制主库头（gli/）到 include/，消费者
                         test_package（find_package + #include <gli/...>）编译时找不到
                         glm/glm.hpp —— 依赖头未随包分发。
rec_approach:           Header-only-随包分发内置依赖头
rec_description:        conanfile.py package() 中除复制主库头目录外，把
                         source_folder/external/<dep>/<dep> 下的头（*.hpp/*.inl/*.h）
                         一并复制到 include/<dep>，保持与上游 vendored 布局一致；
                         package_info() 仅设 includedirs=["include"]（含依赖头自然覆盖）。
                         若依赖在制品仓已有独立配方且版本匹配，可选 requires 替代。
rec_command: |
  # gli 0.8.2.0 实例
  copy(self, "*.hpp", src=join(source_folder, "external", "glm", "glm"),
       dst=join(package_folder, "include", "glm"))
  copy(self, "*.inl", src=join(source_folder, "external", "glm", "glm"),
       dst=join(package_folder, "include", "glm"))
  copy(self, "*.h",   src=join(source_folder, "external", "glm", "glm"),
       dst=join(package_folder, "include", "glm"))
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/g/gli/0.8.2.0 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
affected_scope:         所有带 vendored/bundled 依赖头的 header-only C/C++ 库在 Conan 2 + OHOS 配包装插；gli、glm 类同族库
rec_priority:           1
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe-pattern
keywords:               header-only, vendored, bundled, external, glm, include, package, consumer, conan
